<title>USA: Billerica, Mass., won by BayBank Boston.</title>
<headline>Billerica, Mass., won by BayBank Boston.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BayBank Boston said it won $6.270 million of Billerica, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.09 percent.</p>
</text>
